plugin provides a dockable chat interface within the Godot editor, designed to communicate with an AI backend (e.g., via Cloudflare Workers) over WebSockets.\r\n\r\nKey features implemented:\r\n- Basic plugin structure and registration.\r\n- Chat UI with message history, input field, and send button.\r\n- WebSocket client integration for backend communication.\r\n- Core functionalities:\r\n  - Scene Manipulation: Handles a `CREATE_NODE` command from the AI to create new nodes in the edited scene, with undo/redo support.\r\n  - Scripting Assistance: Handles an `INSERT_CODE_SNIPPET` command to insert code into the active script editor, with undo/redo support.\r\n- Project Understanding:\r\n  - Handles a `GET_PROJECT_SETTING` command to retrieve and send project settings to the AI.\r\n  - Handles a `LIST_SCENE_FILES` command to scan and send a list of scene files to the AI.\r\n\r\nThis implementation serves as a proof of concept for an AI-first game development experience within the Godot editor. Further testing, refinement, and expansion of AI commands are required for a production-ready feature.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyN